			"notes": "LyricsCraft 1.0.0 for **Minecraft 26.3**.\n\n- Lyrics that follow your song, on screen or in the world\n- Words that land on blocks as they're sung\n- Arabic reads correctly, right to left\n- Now-playing card with the album cover\n\n**Install:** put `lyricscraft-1.0.0+mc26.3.jar` in your `mods` folder (needs Fabric and Fabric API). Coming from LyricsPlus? Remove it; your settings carry over.\n\n**Optional:** play your music in [ytr-music](https://github.com/iAlturki/ytr-music) for the best results.\n\nMade by [iALTURKi](https://github.com/iAlturki).\n\nSHA-256: `64ed3e037abb71b2f38e391d3054e13ec5e4b7908b771fb55bf1f27e244b0f1c`"
